// module-missing-module-errors.ta — NEGATIVE test (issue #105): importing a
// module that does not exist must fail the build with a clean
// "error: module not found: <写出名>" message, not crash the VM
// (previously: "error: cdr: expected pair or nil, got tag=0xff08" +
// "** CRASH pid 1" at resolve_imports)。裸名（同样被拒，只是走卫生检查那条
// 路）见 import-bare-name-errors.ta。
//
// expect: error: module not found: tinyactor:lib/definitely_missing_mod_xyz

import "tinyactor:lib/definitely_missing_mod_xyz"

fn main() {
  print(1)
}